.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Self-hosted Langfuse secrets (docker-compose.langfuse.yml); only the names-only example is tracked.
.env.langfuse
!.env.langfuse.example
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
backend/data/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
build-*.log
eval/results/*.json
!eval/results/.gitkeep
deploy/production/secrets/*
!deploy/production/secrets/README.md
# Downloaded source bytes (PDFs, scans, images, audio, video): never commit
/data/
CHANGELOG.md
